---
description: Ignore vault-encrypted secrets files to avoid decryption errors and accidental exposure.
globs: "**/*secrets.yml"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Ignore Secrets Files

These files contain sensitive encrypted data (Ansible Vault). 

- Do not attempt to read or edit these files directly unless explicitly requested.
- Use the `.redacted.yml` counterparts for understanding the expected variable structure and adding fake entries for new secret variables referenced.
- Never commit the actual encrypted secrets files (they are excluded by `.gitignore`).
